#: about.php include/global_arrays.php include/top_general_header.php
#: include/top_header.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "O programu Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti je osmišljen kao cjelovito rješenje za izradu grafikona temeljeno na bazi podataka vremenskih serija (TSDB) i alatu za izradu grafikona RRDtool. Njegov je cilj olakšati posao mrežnom administratoru brigom o svim važnim pojedinostima potrebnim za stvaranje smislenih grafikona."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Posjetite službenu %sweb-stranicu sustava Cacti%s za informacije o upotrebi sustava Cacti, dobivanju podrške i ažuriranjima."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktivni razvojni programeri"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Programeri koji rade na sustavu Cacti, njegovoj arhitekturi, dokumentaciji i budućim izdanjima."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Počasna spominjanja"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Suradnici na dokumentaciji, osiguravanju kvalitete (QA), pakiranju, forumima i našoj YouTube stranici."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Članovi emeritusi"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Članovi izvorne skupine Cacti Group koji su u međuvremenu nastavili svoje karijere drugdje. I dalje im želimo sve najbolje."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Zahvale"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Posebna zahvala upućena je osobi %sTobi Oetiker%s, tvorcu alata %sRRDtool%s i vrlo popularnog alata %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Korisnici sustava Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Posebno svima koji su odvojili vrijeme za prijavu problema ili na drugi način pomogli u ispravljanju poteškoća vezanih uz Cacti. Također i svima koji su pridonijeli podršci za Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licencija"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti je licenciran pod licencijom GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ovaj je program slobodan softver; možete ga distribuirati i/ili mijenjati pod uvjetima opće javne licencije GNU (GNU General Public License) kako ju je objavila Zaklada za slobodni softver (Free Software Foundation); bilo inačice 2 licencije ili (po vašem izboru) bilo koje novije inačice."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ovaj se program distribuira u nadi da će biti koristan, ali BEZ IKAKVOG JAMSTVA; čak i bez podrazumijevanog jamstva TRŽIŠNE PRIKLADNOSTI ili PRIKLADNOSTI ZA ODREĐENU SVRHU. Pogledajte GNU General Public License za više pojedinosti."

