#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Najveći broj ponavljanja za Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Za SNMPv2 i SNMPv3 uređaje, najveći broj ponavljanja (max-repetitions) za SNMP Bulk Walk. Zadano je 'Automatsko otkrivanje pri ponovnom indeksiranju'. Za vrlo velike preklopnike, poslužitelje visokih performansi, mreže s jumbo okvirima ili WAN veze s velikom latencijom, povećanje ove vrijednosti može poboljšati performanse sakupljača podataka. Više podataka pakira se u jedan SNMP paket, što može smanjiti vrijeme izvođenja upita za podatke. Međutim, neki uređaji mogu potpuno odbiti odgovoriti na pakete s prevelikim brojem ponavljanja. To osobito vrijedi za IoT uređaje manje snage ili manje ugrađene IT uređaje. Također treba obratiti posebnu pozornost na ukupni MTU mrežne putanje jer postavljanje previsoke vrijednosti može dovesti do fragmentacije paketa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect on Re-Index"
msgstr "Automatsko otkrivanje pri ponovnom indeksiranju"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Automatsko otkrivanje/postavljanje pri prvom ponovnom indeksiranju"

