#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Pri korištenju osnovne provjere autentičnosti, ako postoje poteškoće s mapiranjem korisničkog imena na valjani Cacti račun, korisnicima će se prikazati ovdje unesena poruka. Može sadržavati i tekst i HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Datoteka mapiranja osnovne provjere autentičnosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Pri korištenju osnovne provjere autentičnosti, ako je osnovni račun potrebno prevesti na drugi račun za prijavu, ovdje možete navesti CSV datoteku za mapiranje osnovnog računa na željeni račun za prijavu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi složenosti lokalnog računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Najmanja duljina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ovo je najmanja duljina dopuštenih lozinki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj miješana velika i mala slova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže i mala i velika slova."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj broj"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže barem 1 brojčani znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj poseban znak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže barem 1 poseban znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Nametni složenost starim lozinkama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da sve stare lozinke također zadovoljavaju nove zahtjeve složenosti prilikom prijave. Ako nisu zadovoljeni, prisilit će promjenu lozinke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Istek neaktivnih računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ovo je najveći broj dana prije nego što se neaktivni računi onemoguće. Račun Admin izuzet je iz ovog pravila."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Istek lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ovo je najveći broj dana prije nego što lozinka istekne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Povijest lozinki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Zapamti ovaj broj starih lozinki i zabrani njihovu ponovnu upotrebu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Email Notification"
msgstr "Obavijest e-poštom o računu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Send email to new user"
msgstr "Pošalji e-poštu novom korisniku"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an admin creates a new account and an email address is entered, send an informational email to it."
msgstr "Kada administrator stvori novi račun i unese adresu e-pošte, pošalji mu obavijesnu poruku e-pošte."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Subject of new account message"
msgstr "Predmet poruke za novi račun"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be used for a new account message."
msgstr "Ovo je predmet poruke e-pošte koji će se koristiti za poruku o novom računu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email body for new account message"
msgstr "Tijelo poruke e-pošte za novi račun"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the message that will be send to new user account. Max 1024 characters. HTML is allowed. There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"
msgstr "Ovo je poruka koja će biti poslana na novi korisnički račun. Najviše 1024 znaka. HTML je dopušten. Postoji nekoliko uobičajenih zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu koristiti, uključujući &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "New Cacti account created. <br>Server: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Username: <USERNAME><br>To login and set a new password, click the <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">password reset link</a><br><br>"
msgstr "Stvoren je novi Cacti račun. <br>Poslužitelj: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Korisničko ime: <USERNAME><br>Za prijavu i postavljanje nove lozinke kliknite <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">poveznicu za ponovno postavljanje lozinke</a><br><br>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Send email when an admin changes an account password"
msgstr "Pošalji e-poštu kada administrator promijeni lozinku računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an admin changes the password of an account and the email address for that account is entered, an informational email will be sent to that address."
msgstr "Kada administrator promijeni lozinku računa i unesena je adresa e-pošte za taj račun, na tu će adresu biti poslana obavijesna poruka e-pošte."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Subject of password reset message"
msgstr "Predmet poruke za ponovno postavljanje lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be used when an admin changes an account password or a user uses 'Forgot password'."
msgstr "Ovo je predmet poruke e-pošte koji će se koristiti kada administrator promijeni lozinku računa ili korisnik upotrijebi 'Zaboravljena lozinka'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti password reset"
msgstr "Ponovno postavljanje lozinke za Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email body for password reset message"
msgstr "Tijelo poruke e-pošte za ponovno postavljanje lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the message that will be sent when a user requests a password reset. Max 1024 characters. HTML is allowed. There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"
msgstr "Ovo je poruka koja će biti poslana kada korisnik zatraži ponovno postavljanje lozinke. Najviše 1024 znaka. HTML je dopušten. Postoji nekoliko uobičajenih zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu koristiti, uključujući &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Your account password has been reset. <br>Server: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Username: <USERNAME><br>To set a new password, click the <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">password reset link</a><br><br>"
msgstr "Lozinka vašeg računa ponovno je postavljena. <br>Poslužitelj: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Korisničko ime: <USERNAME><br>Za postavljanje nove lozinke kliknite <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">poveznicu za ponovno postavljanje lozinke</a><br><br>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reset link validity"
msgstr "Valjanost poveznice za ponovno postavljanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long the password reset link is valid in minutes"
msgstr "Koliko dugo je poveznica za ponovno postavljanje lozinke valjana u minutama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL povezivanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Osnovni URL poslužitelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site. This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Ovo je lokacija poslužitelja koja će se koristiti za poveznice na web-mjesto Cacti. To treba uključivati poddirektorij ako se Cacti ne izvodi iz korijenske mape."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti slanja e-pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Obavijesti primarnog administratora o problemima"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "U slučajevima kada poslužitelj Cacti ima problema, treba li primarnog administratora obavijestiti e-poštom? Cacti korisnički račun primarnog administratora naveden je pod karticom Autentifikacija na stranici s postavkama za Cacti. Zadano je to račun 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Probna e-pošta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Ovo je račun e-pošte koji se koristi za slanje probne poruke kako bi se provjerilo radi li sve ispravno."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Usluge pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Koju uslugu pošte koristiti za slanje pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Pingaj poslužitelj pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Pingati poslužitelj pošte prije slanja probne e-pošte?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte pošiljatelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je adresa e-pošte s koje će izgledati da je e-pošta poslana."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Ime pošiljatelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from. Not used for OAuth2 method."
msgstr "Ovo je stvarno ime s kojeg će izgledati da je e-pošta poslana. Ne koristi se za metodu OAuth2."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Prelamanje teksta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Ovo je broj znakova koji će biti dopušten prije nego što se redak u e-pošti automatski prelomi. (0 = Onemogućeno)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti za Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Putanja za Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Ovo je putanja do programa sendmail na vašem poslužitelju. (Koristi se samo ako je Sendmail odabran kao usluga pošte)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "SMTP mogućnosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "Naziv SMTP glavnog računala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Ovo je naziv glavnog računala/IP adresa SMTP poslužitelja na koji ćete slati e-poštu. Za prebacivanje u slučaju pogreške odvojite glavna računala točkom sa zarezom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP priključak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Priključak na SMTP poslužitelju koji se koristi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer."
msgstr "mora biti pozitivan cijeli broj."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP korisničko ime"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Korisničko ime za autentifikaciju prilikom slanja putem SMTP-a. (Ostavite prazno ako ne trebate autentifikaciju.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP lozinka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Lozinka za autentifikaciju prilikom slanja putem SMTP-a. (Ostavite prazno ako ne trebate autentifikaciju.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP sigurnost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Metoda šifriranja koja se koristi za e-poštu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP vremensko ograničenje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Unesite SMTP vremensko ograničenje u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth 2 Options"
msgstr "OAuth 2 mogućnosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Provider"
msgstr "OAuth2 davatelj usluga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose your OAuth2 provider."
msgstr "Odaberite svog OAuth2 davatelja usluga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email address connected with your oauth."
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte povezana s vašim oauth-om."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Client ID"
msgstr "OAuth2 ID klijenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter OAuth Client"
msgstr "Unesite OAuth klijent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Client Secret"
msgstr "Tajni ključ OAuth2 klijenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter OAuth secret"
msgstr "Unesite tajni ključ za OAuth"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Azure Tenant ID"
msgstr "ID Azure stanara"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only relevant for Azure"
msgstr "Relevantno samo za Azure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Redirect URI"
msgstr "OAuth2 URI za preusmjeravanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please check this URI. It could be accessible from internet."
msgstr "Provjerite ovaj URI. Mogao bi biti dostupan s interneta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 refresh token"
msgstr "OAuth2 token za osvježavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "You can insert here OAuth2 refresh token directly, if you know it. Second option is retrieved from oauth2 provider. In this case set correct OAuth2 setting, save setting and open new browser tab or window and go to OAuth2 Redirect URI"
msgstr "Ovdje možete izravno unijeti OAuth2 token za osvježavanje ako ga znate. Druga je mogućnost dohvaćanje od davatelja OAuth2 usluge. U tom slučaju postavite ispravnu OAuth2 postavku, spremite postavku te otvorite novu karticu ili prozor preglednika i idite na OAuth2 URI za preusmjeravanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Zadane postavke izvješćivanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Zadani format slike grafikona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "Koja se vrsta slike treba koristiti za ugrađene grafikone prilikom stvaranja novog izvješća."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum E-Mail Size"
msgstr "Maksimalna veličina poruke e-pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Maksimalna veličina poruke e-pošte uključujući sve privitke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "Razina zapisivanja ispitivača za Cacti izvješćivanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Koju razinu pojedinosti želite slati u datoteku zapisnika. UPOZORENJE: Ostavljanje u bilo kojem statusu osim NONE ili LOW može brzo iscrpiti vaš prostor na disku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "DNS mogućnosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primarna DNS IP adresa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Unesite primarnu DNS IP adresu koja će se koristiti za obrnuto pretraživanje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekundarna DNS IP adresa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Unesite sekundarnu DNS IP adresu koja će se koristiti za obrnuto pretraživanje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Unesite istek vremena za DNS u milisekundama. Cacti koristi DNS razrješivač temeljen na jeziku PHP."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Postavke internetskog proxy poslužitelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Address"
msgstr "Adresa internetskog proxyja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For either core Cacti Services or Plugins that require internet access, enter the proxy server and port here in the following format IP:PORT.  For example 192.168.1.1:8080."
msgstr "Za osnovne Cacti servise ili dodatke kojima je potreban pristup internetu, ovdje unesite proxy poslužitelj i priključak u sljedećem formatu IP:PORT. Na primjer 192.168.1.1:8080."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy User"
msgstr "Korisnik internetskog proxyja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If your Internet Proxy requires a username, enter it here."
msgstr "Ako vaš internetski proxy zahtijeva korisničko ime, unesite ga ovdje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Password"
msgstr "Lozinka internetskog proxyja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If your Internet Proxy requires a password, enter it here."
msgstr "Ako vaš internetski proxy zahtijeva lozinku, unesite je ovdje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Postavke ažuriranja RRD datoteka na zahtjev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Omogući ažuriranje RRD datoteka na zahtjev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Treba li Boost omogućiti ažuriranje RRD datoteka na zahtjev u sustavu Cacti? Ako to onemogućite, ova promjena neće stupiti na snagu do završetka sljedećeg ciklusa ispitivanja. Kada imate udaljene sakupljače podataka, ova postavka mora biti uključena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Alat za ažuriranje RRD datoteka na razini sustava"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Prije nego što se ažuriranje RRD datoteka na zahtjev može očistiti, uvijek se mora izvršiti jedno pokretanje ispitivača"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Koliko često Boost treba ažurirati sve RRD datoteke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Kada omogućite Boost, vaše se RRD datoteke ažuriraju samo kada ih korisnik zatraži ili kada istekne ovo vremensko razdoblje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Broj Boost procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih Boost procesa koji se koriste za obradu svih RRD datoteka u Boost tablici."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj zapisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ako izlazna tablica sustava Boost premaši ovu veličinu u zapisima, izvršit će se ažuriranje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj stavki izvora podataka po prolazu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Radi optimizacije performansi, Boost alat za ažuriranje RRD datoteka mora znati koliko stavki izvora podataka treba dohvatiti u jednom prolazu. Pazite da ne postavite previsoku vrijednost jer performanse iscrtavanja grafikona tijekom većih ažuriranja mogu biti narušene. Ako primijetite usporavanje iscrtavanja grafikona ili ispitivanja tijekom ažuriranja, smanjite ovaj broj. Zadana vrijednost je 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimalna duljina argumenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Kada Boost šalje naredbe za ažuriranje alatu RRDtool, one ne smiju premašiti maksimalnu duljinu argumenta operacijskog sustava. To ovisi o operacijskom sustavu i razini jezgre. Na primjer: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ neograničeno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije za Boost i ispitivač"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Maksimalna količina memorije za Cacti ispitivač i Boost ispitivač"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme izvođenja skripte za ažuriranje RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Ako Boost ispitivač premaši ovo vrijeme izvođenja, upozorenje će biti zapisano u Cacti zapisnik,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Omogući otklanjanje pogrešaka za Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
